From: iOSPlus10 ios26 port
Subject: [PATCH 0002] NEGRONI machine config for xnu-12377

Port of slop 0004 (negroni-machine-config) and 0006 (master config with open-source asm/pmap) to
xnu-12377.121.6:
- makedefs: NEGRONI in SUPPORTED_ARM64_MACHINE_CONFIGS; stage 1 = plain arm64 at -march=armv8.2-a+crypto,
  NEGRONI_ARM64E=1 = arm64e (stage 2, native PAC; see NEGRONI.h)
- config/MASTER.arm64.negroni: 12377 MASTER.arm64.MacOSX with ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = config_pmap_ppl nos_arm_asm
  nos_arm_pmap (never SPTM or exclaves)
- pexpert/pexpert/arm64/NEGRONI.h (SM8450, GICv3 two security states, Qualcomm vtimer PPI 19), board_config.h,
  proc_reg.h cache lines
- config/Private.exports, Private.arm64.exports: drop the 48 KPI exports (+ IOUnifiedAddressTranslator) that only
  Apple's closed per-SoC library defines (DART/SART/UAT, NVMe PPL, pmap_iommu_*, SPTM gen3 DART): slop 0009 for 12377
The GIC/IRQ code (sleh.c, pe_fiq.c) and start.s parts of slop 0004 are in 0003/0004.

